{"schema":2,"arxiv_id":"2611.26358","title":"Beam Model Technical Report","title_zh":"Beam 模型技术报告","abstract_en":"Beam is a sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model with 501.3B total parameters and 23.4B active parameters, specifically built and optimized for coding, reasoning, and agentic workloads. Beam delivers frontier level reasoning, while requiring 3-4x less inference compute than many models of its class. Pretrained on 23.8T diverse, curated, high-quality tokens, Beam features a 1M-token context window achieved through a novel two-stage midtraining phase, built on verifiable, correctness-anchored data. Post-training leveraged a large-scale, fully asynchronous reinforcement learning (RL) campaign across 10.5K GB300 GPUs, generating over 100M rollouts over 4 weeks of training. We believe this is one of the largest scale RL runs conducted by any open lab to date. Across our evaluation suite, capabilities continued to improve as we increased RL compute, with no sign of a plateau. Supported by deep hardware-model co-design, FP8/NVFP4 quantization, and a 1.93B-parameter speculative decoding drafter (DFlash 2), Beam maximizes serving throughput with efficient, flexible deployment. Averaged across conversation turns and harm categories, Beam refuses or pivots on 88.9% of harmful requests while complying with 81.5% of harmless requests, achieving the highest refusal/pivot rate on harmful requests among open-weight models on the Pareto frontier.","abstract_zh":"Beam 是一款面向代码、推理和智能体任务优化的稀疏混合专家（MoE）模型，总参数量为 5013 亿，每次推理激活 234 亿参数。报告称，Beam 达到前沿推理水平，推理所需算力约为许多同类模型的三分之一至四分之一。模型在 23.8 万亿个来自多样化、经筛选的高质量数据的 token 上完成预训练，并使用正确性可验证的数据开展两阶段中期训练，将上下文窗口扩展至 100 万 token。后训练在 10,500 块 GB300 GPU 上开展全异步强化学习（RL），四周内生成逾 1 亿条采样轨迹（rollouts）；在报告测试的算力范围内，模型能力随 RL 算力增加而持续提升，尚未出现平台期。部署端通过硬件与模型协同设计、FP8/NVFP4 量化，以及拥有 19.3 亿参数的推测解码草稿模型 DFlash 2 提升服务吞吐量。跨对话轮次和危害类别取平均后，Beam 对有害请求的拒绝或转向率为 88.9%，对无害请求的响应率为 81.5%；其有害请求拒绝或转向率在帕累托前沿上的开放权重模型中最高。","authors":["Reflection Team","Adam Abdulhamid","Osama Abuelsorou